  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of the IFU Africa Facility (2025-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the assignment is: 
&#x2022;	To support MFA (L&#xc6;RING) in drafting an independent appraisal of the PD for the capital contribution to the IFU Africa Facility including all relevant supporting documentation ready for submission to the Council for Development Policy (UPR) and final approval by the Foreign Minister.
The overall objective of the appraisal is to assess the relevance, quality and feasibility of the programme design and documentation and if it is fit to underpin programme implementation and produce the expected results in an effective, efficient and sustainable manner in compliance with the principles and rules of Danida policies and Aid Management Guidelines, including the fundamental principles of Doing Development Differently.
The appraisal will provide specific recommendations for adjustments or improvements to the abovementioned document.</narrative>
  </description>
